<BRK/>
<TXT>Within [30] [_____] days of contract award, submit <SUB>manufacturer's catalog data</SUB> for the following items:</TXT><BRK/>
<OLG><BRK/>
<OLI>Epoxy-Resin Binder/Matrix</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Cured Epoxy Binder</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
[<OLI>Aggregate</OLI><BRK/>
